Z||000000||jonny_blaze||11-13-2000||12:41 PM||||hey everybody, how are you guys/girls out there?<P>i need a couple of questions answered...<P>1. can i fit 18" rims on the front wheels?<P>2. where can you find lowering kits for an '86 Fiero Gt?<P>3. does anyone here have a 12" sub in their car, a Tv monitor by chance?<P>4. lastly where do you think i can fit a PS@ in my cab of the car?<P>thanks people||||reg||5
